IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
    PROGRAM-ID. FIFA.

DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-IP1 PIC 9(9).
        01 WS-IP2 PIC 9(3).
        01 WS-A PIC 9(4).
        01 WS-ANSWER PIC 9(4).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-IP1.
    ACCEPT WS-IP2.
    DIVIDE WS-IP1 BY WS-IP2 GIVING WS-A.
    ADD WS-A to 2022 GIVING WS-ANSWER.

    DISPLAY WS-ANSWER.

STOP RUN.
